# Only the Nellutla game is published. Everything else in this folder stays local:
#   cars/  third-party GTA mod archives (not ours to redistribute)
#   rea/   someone else's repository
#   map/   the separate Sandy Shores map
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/serve.py
!/innova-nellutla/
!/nellutla-map/
.DS_Store
innova-nellutla/models/*.glb
__pycache__/
